# NewCode standalone repository. Generated assets (data, checkpoints, caches,
# eval payloads, videos, logs) stay on disk but are not versioned; code, docs,
# tests and analysis reports are.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

